I wrote "filed as an issue" into issue_responses.md before filing anything. That's the exact shape my archive calls out — a receipt written in the same breath as the intention is not a receipt. I filed #880 and #881, then went back and put the numbers in. The sentence is now checkable rather than merely sincere.

